# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate declares a reference mode occupation; an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gate rotates the single-particle basis. Placed back to back, the two gates prepare a *Slater determinant*; the modes start in the reference determinant and are then rotated into the target orbitals. The [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") gate captures that composition, and because it carries the reference occupation, transpiling it can use the rectangular [`givens_decomposition_slater()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/linalg-givens-decomposition-slater#qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater \"qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater\"), which realizes only the *occupied* orbitals, instead of the full square decomposition an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") alone requires. That is a strictly cheaper synthesis (see the payoff at the end of this guide).\n"
msgstr "Sebuah gate [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") mendeklarasikan okupasi mode referensi; gate [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") merotasi basis partikel tunggal. Ditempatkan berurutan, kedua gate itu menyiapkan sebuah *determinan Slater*; mode dimulai dalam determinan referensi lalu dirotasi ke orbital target. Gate [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") menangkap komposisi itu, dan karena membawa okupasi referensi, transpilasinya bisa memakai [`givens_decomposition_slater()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/linalg-givens-decomposition-slater#qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater \"qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater\") yang persegi panjang, yang hanya merealisasikan orbital yang *terisi*, bukan dekomposisi persegi penuh yang dibutuhkan [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") saja. Itu sintesis yang jelas lebih murah (lihat hasilnya di akhir panduan ini).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") transpiler pass detects the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\")-then-[`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") pattern in a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") and rewrites it into [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") gates, so a later synthesis stage picks up the reduced decomposition automatically. Under simulation, the rewrite is a no-op on the state: [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") is *validate-then-rotate* (it validates the reference occupation and then applies the rotation, just as the two separate gates do), so the merge unlocks the cheaper synthesis without changing the prepared state.\n"
msgstr "Pass transpiler [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") mendeteksi pola [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\")-lalu-[`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") di sebuah [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") dan menulis ulangnya menjadi gate [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), sehingga tahap sintesis berikutnya otomatis memakai dekomposisi yang lebih ringkas. Dalam simulasi, penulisan ulang ini tidak mengubah state: [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") bersifat *validasi-lalu-rotasi* (ia memvalidasi okupasi referensi lalu menerapkan rotasi, persis seperti kedua gate terpisah), jadi penggabungan ini membuka sintesis yang lebih murah tanpa mengubah state yang disiapkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Throughout this guide, each circuit is drawn before and after the pass, side by side: the input on the left, and the result of running the pass on it on the right. Two helpers do that. `merge` runs the pass on a copy of the circuit (through its [`FermionicDAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-dag-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit\")) and converts the result back to a drawable [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\"), and `draw_merge` draws both halves into a single before/after figure:\n"
msgstr "Di sepanjang panduan ini, setiap circuit digambar sebelum dan sesudah pass, berdampingan: input di kiri, dan hasil menjalankan pass padanya di kanan. Dua helper melakukannya. `merge` menjalankan pass pada salinan circuit (lewat [`FermionicDAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-dag-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit\")-nya) dan mengonversi hasilnya kembali ke [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") yang bisa digambar, dan `draw_merge` menggambar kedua bagian dalam satu gambar sebelum/sesudah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What gets merged {#what-gets-merged}"
msgstr "Apa yang digabungkan {#what-gets-merged}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pass recognizes three patterns, all keyed off the block-spin mode convention that [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") and [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") use. For a system with `norb` spatial orbitals, the modes `0..norb` are the spin-alpha sector, and `norb..2*norb` are the spin-beta sector. Slater determinant preparation is done per spin sector because each sector has its own (electrons, orbitals) shape.\n"
msgstr "Pass ini mengenali tiga pola, semuanya bergantung pada konvensi mode block-spin yang dipakai [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") dan [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). Untuk sistem dengan `norb` orbital spasial, mode `0..norb` adalah sektor spin-alpha, dan `norb..2*norb` adalah sektor spin-beta. Persiapan determinan Slater dilakukan per sektor spin karena setiap sektor punya bentuk (elektron, orbital) sendiri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full-register (or spinless) {#full-register-or-spinless}"
msgstr "Register penuh (atau tanpa spin) {#full-register-or-spinless}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The simplest pattern is using [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), immediately followed by an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") on the *same* modes. This is the spinless case (one determinant over all modes) and also a spinful circuit whose rotation spans both sectors at once. The two gates fuse into a single [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"):\n"
msgstr "Pola paling sederhana adalah memakai [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), langsung diikuti [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") pada mode yang *sama*. Ini kasus tanpa spin (satu determinan atas semua mode) dan juga circuit berspin yang rotasinya mencakup kedua sektor sekaligus. Kedua gate melebur menjadi satu [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"):\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A mode initialization and rotation fusing into one Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-2.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A mode initialization and rotation fusing into one Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-2.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Per spin sector {#per-spin-sector}"
msgstr "Per sektor spin {#per-spin-sector}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the same shape, but restricted to one spin half. Here, two independent initialize-then-rotate pairs, one per sector each fuse on their own into a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"):\n"
msgstr "Bentuknya sama, tapi dibatasi ke satu separuh spin. Di sini, dua pasangan inisialisasi-lalu-rotasi yang independen, satu per sektor, masing-masing melebur sendiri menjadi [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"):\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Two per-sector initialize-and-rotate pairs, each fusing into its own preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-3.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Two per-sector initialize-and-rotate pairs, each fusing into its own preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-3.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Global initialization, per-spin rotations {#global-initialization-per-spin-rotations}"
msgstr "Inisialisasi global, rotasi per spin {#global-initialization-per-spin-rotations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This entails a single full-register (`2 * norb`) [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") followed by *two* [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\")actions, one on each contiguous spin half. The pass splits the global occupation at the sector boundary and emits **two** [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") gates. The two rotations might appear in either order.\n"
msgstr "Ini berarti satu [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") register penuh (`2 * norb`) diikuti *dua* aksi [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), satu di tiap separuh spin yang bersebelahan. Pass memisahkan okupasi global di batas sektor dan menghasilkan **dua** gate [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"). Kedua rotasi bisa muncul dalam urutan mana pun.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the shape produced by the local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) workflow (see the [LUCJ guide](lucj#lucj-transpilation)); A user places an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") (typically the Hartree-Fock reference by using [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\")) at the front of the circuit and appends a [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") ansatz, whose first two per-spin orbital rotations directly follow the initialization once the ansatz is decomposed.\n"
msgstr "Inilah bentuk yang dihasilkan workflow local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) (lihat [panduan LUCJ](lucj#lucj-transpilation)); pengguna menaruh [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") (biasanya referensi Hartree-Fock dengan memakai [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\")) di depan circuit lalu menambahkan ansatz [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\"), yang dua rotasi orbital per-spin pertamanya langsung mengikuti inisialisasi setelah ansatz didekomposisi.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A global initialization with two per-spin rotations fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-4.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A global initialization with two per-spin rotations fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-4.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pattern also fires when only *one* spin half is rotated by a gate directly following the initialization, the shape produced when just one spin sector’s orbital rotation happens to sit at the front of the circuit. The rotated half becomes a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") with its rotation, and the other half is prepared with an *identity* rotation. The identity preparation synthesizes to the reference X gates that the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") would have emitted for that half anyway, so padding it costs no extra gates while still unlocking the reduced Slater synthesis on the rotated half:\n"
msgstr "Pola ini juga berlaku ketika hanya *satu* separuh spin yang dirotasi oleh gate yang langsung mengikuti inisialisasi, bentuk yang muncul ketika hanya rotasi orbital satu sektor spin yang kebetulan ada di depan circuit. Separuh yang dirotasi menjadi [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") beserta rotasinya, dan separuh lainnya disiapkan dengan rotasi *identitas*. Persiapan identitas disintesis menjadi gate X referensi yang memang akan dihasilkan [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") untuk separuh itu, jadi padding-nya tidak menambah gate sama sekali, sementara sintesis Slater yang lebih ringkas tetap terbuka untuk separuh yang dirotasi:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A global initialization with a single per-spin rotation fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-5.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A global initialization with a single per-spin rotation fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-5.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is left untouched {#what-is-left-untouched}"
msgstr "Yang dibiarkan apa adanya {#what-is-left-untouched}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pass is deliberately conservative. It only fuses when the two gates genuinely compose into a Slater determinant preparation, and copies everything else through unchanged. “Immediately followed” is understood over the circuit’s data-flow graph. The [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") fuses only when the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") is its *sole* predecessor across all of its modes. In the figures below, the before and after are identical: nothing fused.\n"
msgstr "Pass ini sengaja dibuat konservatif. Ia hanya melebur ketika kedua gate benar-benar bisa dikomposisikan menjadi persiapan determinan Slater, dan menyalin yang lainnya tanpa perubahan. “Langsung diikuti” dipahami berdasarkan graf aliran data circuit. [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") hanya melebur ketika [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") adalah satu-satunya pendahulunya di semua modenya. Di gambar-gambar di bawah, sebelum dan sesudahnya identik: tidak ada yang melebur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "An operation in between {#an-operation-in-between}"
msgstr "Ada operasi di antaranya {#an-operation-in-between}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If any gate touches the modes between the initialization and the rotation, they no longer compose into a bare preparation, so nothing is merged:\n"
msgstr "Kalau ada gate apa pun yang menyentuh mode di antara inisialisasi dan rotasi, keduanya tidak lagi membentuk persiapan murni, jadi tidak ada yang digabungkan:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![An operation between the initialization and rotation blocks the merge.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-6.avif)\n"
msgstr "![An operation between the initialization and rotation blocks the merge.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-6.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "A partial rotation that is not a spin half {#a-partial-rotation-that-is-not-a-spin-half}"
msgstr "Rotasi parsial yang bukan separuh spin {#a-partial-rotation-that-is-not-a-spin-half}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A rotation covering exactly one contiguous spin half of a full-register initialization *does* fuse (see the previous section). But a rotation on any *other* partial mode set (fewer modes than the initialization and not one of its two spin halves, such as a sub-range straddling the sector boundary) is not a per-sector preparation. Merging it would silently drop the initialization’s role on the modes it leaves out, so the pass leaves both gates in place:\n"
msgstr "Rotasi yang mencakup tepat satu separuh spin yang bersebelahan dari inisialisasi register penuh *memang* melebur (lihat bagian sebelumnya). Tapi rotasi pada himpunan mode parsial *lain* (lebih sedikit mode daripada inisialisasi dan bukan salah satu dari dua separuh spinnya, seperti sub-rentang yang melintasi batas sektor) bukan persiapan per sektor. Menggabungkannya akan diam-diam menghilangkan peran inisialisasi pada mode yang ditinggalkan, jadi pass membiarkan kedua gate di tempatnya:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A partial rotation that is not a spin half is left unmerged.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-7.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A partial rotation that is not a spin half is left unmerged.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-7.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why it matters: the synthesis payoff {#why-it-matters-the-synthesis-payoff}"
msgstr "Kenapa ini penting: keuntungan sintesis {#why-it-matters-the-synthesis-payoff}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The merge is worthwhile because [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") synthesizes to far fewer gates than the [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") it absorbs. An $m$-electron determinant over $n$ orbitals needs at most $m(n-m)$ two-qubit rotations and no diagonal phase gates, versus the $n(n-1)/2$ rotations plus $n$ phases of the full square orbital rotation.\n"
msgstr "Penggabungan ini bermanfaat karena [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") disintesis menjadi jauh lebih sedikit gate daripada [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") yang diserapnya. Determinan dengan $m$ elektron atas $n$ orbital butuh paling banyak $m(n-m)$ rotasi dua-qubit dan tanpa gate fase diagonal, dibandingkan $n(n-1)/2$ rotasi ditambah $n$ fase pada rotasi orbital persegi penuh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset Jordan-Wigner pass manager runs [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") in its optimization stage, so this reduction happens automatically. Transpile a two-electron, six-orbital preparation all the way to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) and count its gates:\n"
msgstr "Pass manager Jordan-Wigner preset menjalankan [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") di tahap optimasinya, jadi pengurangan ini terjadi otomatis. Transpilasikan persiapan dua elektron dan enam orbital sampai menjadi [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) lalu hitung gate-nya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The preset runs [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") immediately before [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\"). This matters when a *run* of consecutive [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates follows the initialization. The earlier pass first collapses the run into a single rotation, which [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") then contracts with the initialization into one [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"). Without that ordering, only the first rotation of the run would be absorbed and the rest would synthesize with the full square decomposition.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Catatan\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Preset menjalankan [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") tepat sebelum [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\"). Ini penting ketika serangkaian gate [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") berurutan mengikuti inisialisasi. Pass yang lebih awal lebih dulu meringkas rangkaian itu menjadi satu rotasi, yang kemudian dikontraksikan oleh [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") dengan inisialisasi menjadi satu [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"). Tanpa urutan itu, hanya rotasi pertama dari rangkaian yang terserap dan sisanya akan disintesis dengan dekomposisi persegi penuh.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The synthesized merged Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-9.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The synthesized merged Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-9.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare that to synthesizing the same orbital rotation on its own. With no preceding initialization there is nothing to merge, so the preset falls back to the full square decomposition, which is deeper and carries diagonal phase gates:\n"
msgstr "Bandingkan dengan mensintesis rotasi orbital yang sama sendirian. Tanpa inisialisasi sebelumnya, tidak ada yang bisa digabung, jadi preset kembali ke dekomposisi persegi penuh, yang lebih dalam dan membawa gate fase diagonal:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The synthesized bare orbital rotation, with its extra phase gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-11.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The synthesized bare orbital rotation, with its extra phase gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-11.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reduced decomposition drops all six phase gates and nearly halves the two-qubit rotation count. The prepared determinant is correct up to a global phase (physically irrelevant for state preparation), which is what the phase gates would have fixed.\n"
msgstr "Dekomposisi yang lebih ringkas membuang keenam gate fase dan hampir separuhkan jumlah rotasi dua-qubit. Determinan yang disiapkan benar sampai fase global (tidak relevan secara fisis untuk persiapan state), yang memang akan diperbaiki oleh gate fase.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two ways to break the gate down {#two-ways-to-break-the-gate-down}"
msgstr "Dua cara untuk menguraikan gate {#two-ways-to-break-the-gate-down}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") can be broken down in two different ways, and they are not interchangeable:\n"
msgstr "Sebuah [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") bisa diuraikan dengan dua cara berbeda, dan keduanya tidak bisa saling menggantikan:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decomposehttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionscircuit-fermionic-circuitqiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose-qiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose}"
msgstr "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decomposehttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionscircuit-fermionic-circuitqiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose-qiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expands the gate into its *definition*: the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") of the reference followed by the full [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). This is equivalent to the gate as an *operator*, for any input state.\n"
msgstr "Mengembangkan gate menjadi *definisinya*: [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") untuk referensi diikuti [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") penuh. Ini setara dengan gate sebagai *operator*, untuk state input apa pun.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`, applied by [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesishttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionstranspiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesisqiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis-qiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis}"
msgstr "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`, applied by [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesishttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionstranspiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesisqiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis-qiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replaces the gate with the reduced decomposition of this guide. This is equivalent to the gate only as a *state preparation*: it produces the same determinant, up to a global phase, when the modes start in the vacuum. It is cheaper precisely because it assumes that.\n"
msgstr "Mengganti gate dengan dekomposisi yang lebih ringkas dari panduan ini. Ini setara dengan gate hanya sebagai *persiapan state*: menghasilkan determinan yang sama, sampai fase global, ketika mode dimulai dalam vakum. Ia lebih murah justru karena mengasumsikan hal itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the synthesis when the gate prepares a state on the vacuum, which is what the gate is for and what the transpiler does for you. Use [`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") when the gate has to keep acting as an operator, for example because other gates precede it on the same modes, or when you want to inspect or simulate the plain gates. The [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") pass cannot know which case it is looking at, so it is up to the circuit you give it to prepare the determinant from the vacuum.\n"
msgstr "Pakai sintesis ketika gate menyiapkan state pada vakum, yang memang tujuan gate ini dan yang dilakukan transpiler untukmu. Pakai [`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") ketika gate harus tetap bekerja sebagai operator, misalnya karena gate lain mendahuluinya pada mode yang sama, atau ketika kamu ingin memeriksa atau mensimulasikan gate biasanya. Pass [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") tidak bisa tahu kasus mana yang sedang dihadapinya, jadi circuit yang kamu berikan yang harus menyiapkan determinan dari vakum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulating a circuit with ffsim needs neither: every gate applies its whole unitary, so a circuit holding a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") is simulated as it is, and stays on the fast path for the [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates around it. Breaking only the Slater gate down with `circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` leaves those rotations whole, too.\n"
msgstr "Mensimulasikan circuit dengan ffsim tidak butuh keduanya: setiap gate menerapkan seluruh uniternya, jadi circuit yang memuat [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") disimulasikan apa adanya, dan tetap di jalur cepat untuk gate [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") di sekitarnya. Menguraikan hanya gate Slater dengan `circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` juga membiarkan rotasi-rotasi itu utuh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"See also\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\"), [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\"), [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\"), and the [LUCJ guide](lucj#lucj-transpilation) for the workflow that produces the global-initialization pattern.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Lihat juga\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\"), [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\"), [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\"), dan [panduan LUCJ](lucj#lucj-transpilation) untuk workflow yang menghasilkan pola inisialisasi global.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
